","start":552,"end":552.12},{"text":"massage","start":552.12,"end":552.56},{"text":"our","start":552.56,"end":552.92},{"text":"scalp","start":552.92,"end":553.18},{"text":"again,","start":553.18,"end":553.98},{"text":"clockwise","start":553.98,"end":554.48},{"text":"seven","start":554.48,"end":554.94},{"text":"times.","start":554.94,"end":555.44}]},{"text":"Lift our hand up. We can compare the sensation now to before.","start":563.94,"end":570.2,"words":[{"text":"Lift","start":563.94,"end":564.24},{"text":"our","start":564.24,"end":564.56},{"text":"hand","start":564.56,"end":564.76},{"text":"up.","start":564.76,"end":565.36},{"text":"We","start":567.06,"end":567.08},{"text":"can","start":567.08,"end":567.3},{"text":"compare","start":567.3,"end":567.66},{"text":"the","start":567.66,"end":567.94},{"text":"sensation","start":567.94,"end":568.38},{"text":"now","start":568.38,"end":569.1},{"text":"to","start":569.1,"end":569.32},{"text":"before.","start":569.32,"end":570.2}]},{"text":"And taking that hand down, also check with our left hand some 5-7 centimeters above our head.","start":574.28,"end":580.34,"words":[{"text":"And","start":574.28,"end":574.4},{"text":"taking","start":574.4,"end":574.64},{"text":"that","start":574.64,"end":574.98},{"text":"hand","start":574.98,"end":575.18},{"text":"down,","start":575.18,"end":575.56},{"text":"also","start":575.56,"end":575.78},{"text":"check","start":575.78,"end":576.02},{"text":"with","start":576.02,"end":576.26},{"text":"our","start":576.26,"end":576.44},{"text":"left","start":576.44,"end":576.66},{"text":"hand","start":576.66,"end":577.08},{"text":"some","start":577.08,"end":577.62},{"text":"5-7","start":578.04,"end":578.7},{"text":"centimeters","start":578.7,"end":579.24},{"text":"above","start":579.24,"end":579.66},{"text":"our","start":579.66,"end":579.94},{"text":"head.","start":579.94,"end":580.34}]},{"text":"We can observe how we feel on our hands above our head and take our hand down, back down on our lap.","start"